   a. distribute, publish, sublicense, sell or rent the Kit or any part of
      it, other than a Theme you created;
   b. use the Kit, the reference stylesheet or the documentation to build,
      style or operate a player or a streaming service other than ViewStream;
   c. copy, modify, decompile or reverse engineer the Player, or host your
      own copy of the Player's code or stylesheets;
   d. use the sample media for anything other than testing inside the
      workbench;
   e. remove or change any copyright or license notice.

